  "walkthroughs": [
    {
      "tag": "Mix",
      "h2": "Greens and Browns",
      "body_html": "<p>A good compost mixes about <strong>50/50 greens and browns</strong>. Greens add nitrogen and moisture; browns add carbon and air spaces.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Heat",
      "h2": "How It Rots",
      "body_html": "<p>Bacteria and fungi (decomposers) eat the mix. The heap warms up, even on cold days. Worms help speed it along.</p>"
    },
    {
      "tag": "Turn",
      "h2": "Turning the Pile",
      "body_html": "<p>Every few weeks, <strong>aerate</strong> by turning the heap with a fork. Air helps the decomposers and stops smells.</p>"
    }
  ],
